  "description": "A brown varsity jacket brings warm, understated color to everyday outfits. Students and casual wearers can pair its brown body and beige sleeves with denim or simple layers for a classic campus look.\n\nDetails\n- Body: brown 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: beige genuine cowhide leather\n- Trim: brown and beige striped knit collar, cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore brown letterman jacket styling or brown and beige varsity jacket with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
